# graphify: keyless, code-only, zero-egress baseline for this repository.
#
# Rationale
# ---------
# Code files are parsed locally with tree-sitter (AST). That path makes no LLM
# calls and needs no API key. Docs, papers and images are the only inputs that
# require a semantic LLM backend, so they are excluded here to keep the graph
# fully local and free to rebuild.
#
# SECURITY: Installers/ is excluded unconditionally. It holds offline installer
# binaries and, per CLAUDE.md, Installers\EXE\CrowdStrike\Readme.txt may contain
# real CrowdStrike Customer ID and installation token values. Nothing under
# Installers/ may ever be read into a graph or sent to a semantic backend.
# Do not remove the Installers/ rules below.

# --- Secrets and machine-local payloads (never index) ---
Installers/
Logs/
Assets/

# --- Repository metadata / transient noise ---
.git/
.claude/
graphify-out/
*.lock
*-lock.json

# --- Installer and binary payloads ---
*.exe
*.msi
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.dll
*.ocx
*.pdb
*.pak
*.iso
*.img
*.zip
*.cab
*.bin
*.dat
*.xig

# --- Media ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.svg
*.ico
*.webp
*.tiff
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.avi

# --- Docs / papers / plain text (require an LLM backend for extraction) ---
# Remove selected lines and rebuild with a backend if you later want
# README.md / TESTING.md concepts in the graph. Never re-enable *.txt
# without first confirming Installers/ is still excluded.
*.md
*.mdx
*.txt
*.TXT
*.rst
*.html
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.csv
*.yaml
*.yml
*.log
*.cfg
*.ini
